7. Removed the require-based imports and replaced with ES modules
8. Added proper provider wrapping for the component

These changes should resolve the "require is not defined" error and provide the necessary context for the component to render properly. The i18n functionality is now properly mocked using the browser-compatible ES modules approach instead of CommonJS require statements.

